==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 2~8 seconds<sup>60f~240f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 2~9.33 seconds<sup>60f~280f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 2~10.67 seconds<sup>60f~320f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Hippoe]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 33.33~80 seconds<sup>1,000f~2,400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[One Horn]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 0.67~8 seconds<sup>20f~240f</sup>.
**4 [[Kang Roo]]s spawn, delay 0.67~1.33 seconds<sup>20f~40f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

